#
# Well-formed: a math:StatisticalVariable whose values encode absence — it carries a
# math:MissingnessIndicator through math:hasMissingnessIndicator — AND declares the
# math:MissingnessMechanism an analysis depending on it rests on, through
# math:missingnessMechanism. Because the mechanism is declared, math:ImplicitMissingnessShape
# is satisfied and validation emits no findings.
# Bound by ex:ecImplicitMissingnessDeclared.
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:income a math:StatisticalVariable ;
    math:hasMissingnessIndicator ex:incomeMissing ;
    math:missingnessMechanism ex:incomeMechanism .
ex:incomeMissing a math:MissingnessIndicator .
ex:incomeMechanism a math:MissingnessMechanism .
